WEBVTT

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Zero kara kakedashite

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:04.130
Start running from the beginning,

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
Omoi dake wo dakishimete

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.500
with nothing but your emotions in your hands.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Sonomama kakenukete

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:11.890
Just keep running...

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
Itsumo koko de mitsumeteru

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:18.350
I'm always watching you from here.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
Hajimete deatta hi no manazashi wasurenai

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:42.300
I still remember your expression the day we first met.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
Taiyou mitai ni kokoro wo terashitekureta

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:49.190
It lit up my heart like the sun.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
Asu no yukue sagashite nayandeiru nara

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.960
If you're anxious about where to go tomorrow,

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
Ima kimi no tame ni akari ni naritai yo

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:06.890
I want to become a beacon to you.

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Zero kara tobidatte

00:01:08.480 --> 00:01:12.010
Start flying from the beginning.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Ima no kimi wo toki hanachi

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:16.380
Let go of your current self...

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
Mugen ni habataite

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:19.730
and fly towards infinity.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
Donna toki mo mimaru yo

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:23.600
I will always watch over you...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
Kitto zutto tooku made

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:29.510
no matter how far you fly.

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:36.080
Episode 28 - The Inadequate Actress

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.070
My mom is dead because of him.

00:01:46.270 --> 00:01:49.970
Hayami Masumi killed my mother!

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.190
It's no different.

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:54.710
Hey Maya, what's with that look?

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:56.360
Have a drink.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:59.610
Yeah, have a drink already!

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:07.840
The show opens today!

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.760
Something must have happened to her!

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:11.970
Maybe she's been kidnapped. Or had an accident.

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:15.310
Stop it! I'm going to make sure she comes back to us safe and sound.

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:18.840
I've got my men looking everywhere for her.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:22.490
Where are you, little one?

00:02:22.490 --> 00:02:25.070
Please... I hope you're safe.

00:02:28.600 --> 00:02:29.910
Hayami here...

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:31.930
What?!

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.680
Are you absolutely sure?

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:35.750
Yes.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.780
It was Maya Kitajima.

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.900
She was talking to two women.

00:02:39.900 --> 00:02:42.600
One of them looked like a nurse.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.070
What were they talking about?

00:02:44.070 --> 00:02:46.430
I only heard snatches of it.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:50.510
Something about how her mother wasn't allowed visitors.

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:53.150
And how this was brought about by someone by the name of Hayami.

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:58.310
Then, she turned white as a sheet and was taken away...

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:00.400
by what looked like a gang of louts.

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:02.850
A gang?!

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:08.720
Yes, I want you to find out where that gang is right now.

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:12.870
So, now she knows what happened.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:18.850
She probably wants me dead right about now.

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:22.880
You know, that girl's the only one who can make Daito Entertainment's workaholic...

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.070
look like you do right now.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:29.200
You don't believe in love or affection, and yet,

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:31.680
even though she's eleven years younger than you are...

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.320
Miss Mizuki.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:37.640
You're crazy about her. Maya Kitajima.

00:03:37.640 --> 00:03:41.090
And you have been for a long time.

00:03:44.330 --> 00:03:48.290
Shangri La

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:48.290
Is it true that Miss Maya Kitajima's whereabouts are currently unknown?!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:49.900
How do you know about that?!

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:52.290
We've received a number of anonymous tips!

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:28.620
We have no other choice. We'll have to use an understudy.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.620
All right.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:30.870
Excuse me.

00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:34.710
I've memorized all of the lines.

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:36.220
I've been watching the rehearsals for a while now,

00:04:36.220 --> 00:04:38.500
so I know all of the cues too.

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.100
Any luck?

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:41.900
Nope.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:43.920
No one's here.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:47.850
We won't make it before the show starts.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:06.770
We regret to inform our guests that Maya Kitajima is unable to appear on stage tonight.

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:09.100
In her place, the role of Lila will be played by:

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:11.370
Norie Otobe.

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:18.050
Did you find her?

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:25.290
Sleep well for now, Maya, because when you wake up, you'll be in Hell.

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:47.230
It's said that a sudden emergency kept Miss Maya Kitajima...

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:52.350
from appearing on stage for the opening night of <i>Shangri La</i>.

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:56.390
Newcomer Norie Otobe took the role in her place,

00:05:56.390 --> 00:05:58.410
and her performance received rave reviews.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:06.380
Maya Kitajima, who plays the role of Satoko in MBA TV series <i>Heavenly Light</i> is...

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:10.460
Norie Otobe? I don't believe it. That's her?

00:06:10.960 --> 00:06:13.430
So you realize where you stand now.

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:17.110
This man killed my mom!

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.430
How <i>dare</i> he?!

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:20.380
Please, listen!

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:22.900
Maya Kitajima, could we just get a few words from you?

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.300
Be tough.

00:06:26.640 --> 00:06:27.860
You idiot!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:28.940
What the...

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:31.190
No matter how upset you are over your mother's death...

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:34.920
nor how exhausted you are from rehearsals, there's <i>no excuse</i> for leaving the stage like you did!

00:06:35.840 --> 00:06:41.700
You ran off with a disreputable gang and then collapse from exhaustion!

00:06:41.700 --> 00:06:42.910
The whole thing has turned into a scandal!

00:06:43.190 --> 00:06:47.490
You will now apologize to the public for your behavior via the press!

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:52.610
Don't mess this up.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:57.730
I'm sure the fan you love so much was there for the opening show too.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.720
Well, go ahead. Apologize.

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:01.470
From the bottom of your heart.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:09.610
I acted disgracefully and then, I collapsed.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.710
I am truly sorry for my behavior.

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:14.410
I rendered myself unable to appear on stage.

00:07:18.890 --> 00:07:20.990
I couldn't stand on stage-

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.380
the stage that is more important to me than anything else!

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:27.550
Even when Mr. Purple Roses was in the audience.

00:07:27.550 --> 00:07:31.000
I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:32.430
I wish I was dead.

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:35.740
Maya.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:38.170
Everyone, if we please call a halt to proceedings for today.

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:40.750
As you can see, she's at the end of her tether right now, so please.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:45.800
We can do a follow-up later.

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:54.030
I want my mom...

00:07:55.760 --> 00:07:57.420
I want you to bring her back!

00:07:57.420 --> 00:08:01.770
If you hadn't done that, this wouldn't have happened!

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:04.690
She wouldn't have died!

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:10.790
You <i>knew</i> how badly I wanted to see her!

00:08:10.790 --> 00:08:12.420
I will never, ever forgive you for this.

00:08:12.420 --> 00:08:15.370
I'm going to hate you for the rest of my life!

00:08:15.370 --> 00:08:18.270
I'm used to being hated.

00:08:18.900 --> 00:08:23.860
I wanted to make you a star. That's my job.

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:29.870
You can hit and kick me all you want. Do as you please.

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:32.890
But I still don't know how to apologize to you.

00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:37.250
What are you waiting for? Go on.

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:46.540
Mr. Masumi. You are requested back at the office immediately.

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:50.830
I'm sorry. You'll have to take a rain check.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:01.840
This whole thing seems very choreographed.

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:05.020
It looks like someone gave Maya some kind of sleeping pills...

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.200
and then, an anonymous tipster alerted the press.

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:13.400
It's a cruel decision, but I have to do this.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.530
Mr. Masumi...

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.970
Maya, it can't be helped.

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:24.270
That girl has copied your acting style perfectly.

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:30.500
I've become such a fan! Will you let me be your personal assistant?

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:33.840
Are you just going to ignore this and stand up on stage as if nothing's happened?

00:09:34.780 --> 00:09:38.760
And that's not all. I have some more bad news.

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:47.050
And how do you feel about being given this opportunity?

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:51.540
Hi, Maya!

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:52.530
So, what do you think?

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:54.850
Don't you think I look better in this costume?

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.560
Norie...

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:59.150
I'm really sorry it ended up like this.

00:09:59.150 --> 00:10:00.980
But then again, you've made your own bed, so go lie in it.

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:04.690
You've really disappointed me.

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:07.380
I'm sorry, but I have to leave now.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:09.370
I have to meet with the editors.

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:13.540
Given this opportunity, you say? Make no mistake:

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:16.350
you make your own opportunities in this game.

00:10:16.350 --> 00:10:19.020
The role of the Temple Maiden, Lila, and now, Satoko too.

00:10:19.570 --> 00:10:23.000
They've given everything to Norie.

00:10:26.090 --> 00:10:27.490
Everything!

00:10:35.760 --> 00:10:38.120
It looks like this is the end of Maya Kitajima.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:40.870
I guess that means Ayumi's going to get the part...

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:42.500
of the Scarlet Angel.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:46.600
Be quiet. I won't let you make a comment like that again.

00:10:48.520 --> 00:10:51.790
She wouldn't abandon a performance for anything.

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.340
I know that more than anyone.

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:58.290
What really happened, Maya?

00:10:59.140 --> 00:11:01.690
It looks like he's going to be shooting a movie overseas...

00:11:01.690 --> 00:11:03.820
for the next year.

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:06.350
Satomi's going to America?

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:08.470
I know it's hard,

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:11.840
but you should break up with him. For his sake.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.000
You understand, right?

00:11:14.930 --> 00:11:16.620
For his sake?

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:20.950
Right now, Shigeru Satomi is a teen idol at the peak of his popularity.

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:24.970
You need to think about the effect on him if he's in a relationship...

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:27.770
with someone who played truant for a performance and has been replaced...

00:11:27.770 --> 00:11:29.480
in her significant TV role.

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:31.120
Satomi...

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:47.650
Miss Mizuki...

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:53.300
How long will it be before this is all just a memory?

00:11:52.240 --> 00:11:53.300
Oh, Maya...

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:57.330
How long will I be allowed to stay here?

00:11:57.330 --> 00:11:59.930
Daito Entertainment has no more use for me.

00:11:59.930 --> 00:12:04.370
Maya, until your contract is up, you remain under the control of Daito Entertainment.

00:12:04.370 --> 00:12:05.820
Or have you forgotten that already?

00:12:05.820 --> 00:12:07.100
My contract?

00:12:07.660 --> 00:12:09.810
I don't want to be here though.

00:12:13.500 --> 00:12:19.890
Why did you put me here, Ms. Tsukikage?

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:29.080
Reception

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:29.100
I'm sorry, but Ms. Tsukikage is busy right now and can't see you.

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.720
All right.

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:37.990
Why wouldn't you go out to her, ma'am?

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:41.930
She came here for pity and encouragement.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:45.650
Do you really believe this article?

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:48.110
I don't want to believe it, but I can't ignore it.

00:12:48.110 --> 00:12:50.120
If Maya has changed, it's certainly possible.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:53.280
Well, I don't believe it.

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:56.350
Maya would die before she neglected to show up on stage.

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:57.340
Ma'am!

00:12:57.340 --> 00:13:00.770
Are you trying to tell me she's the type of girl who'd hang around with hoodlums?

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:04.720
And it says here they found her drugged up on sleeping pills.

00:13:05.670 --> 00:13:08.050
The world of acting is a scary place...

00:13:08.050 --> 00:13:11.500
and she's fought her way through it by herself.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:17.300
You say she threw away your letters, but did you see her throw them away?

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:19.590
Well, no...

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:24.560
And when you visited her apartment, did she tell you she didn't wish to see you in person?

00:13:24.560 --> 00:13:26.970
You can't allow yourself to be led astray.

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:28.870
There is always only one truth.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:32.540
She's right. We didn't even bother to find out if it was true.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.540
But ma'am, why did you put Maya into Daito Entertainment in the first place?

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:40.150
My first aim was to distance myself from her.

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:42.990
My second aim was to let her discover how the world works by herself.

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:47.060
She's done well, acting on television and in movies.

00:13:47.690 --> 00:13:51.840
If she hadn't gone to Daito, she wouldn't have become the megastar she is now.

00:13:51.840 --> 00:13:54.760
But, in the end, all that's done was shut her out!

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:56.870
She's failed as an actress!

00:13:56.870 --> 00:13:59.940
Failed? You can't be serious.

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:04.210
The results of my third aim have yet to come to light.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:05.630
Your third aim?

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:08.920
My true aim.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:13.630
I am counting on her deep passion for acting.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:19.760
I want to see her turn to <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> of her own accord!

00:14:20.360 --> 00:14:25.770
I want to see her realize that roles cannot be given to you;

00:14:25.770 --> 00:14:28.340
you must grab them with your own two hands.

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:32.590
I'm counting on all of her attributes when she acts!

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:37.910
Please, show me now, Maya. Show me the results of my third aim!

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:42.250
This next piece takes place in Nineteenth Century England.

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:45.590
It's called <i>The Golden Fruit</i>.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:49.220
You'll be playing Marge, a quirky thirteen-year-old tomboy,

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:53.090
Apollo Studios

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:53.080
the granddaughter of an orchard owner.

00:14:53.800 --> 00:14:55.900
She's agreed to get back on stage.

00:14:55.900 --> 00:14:58.750
So, she's reluctantly climbed back on stage...

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:04.280
She couldn't refuse - not as long as she's under contract.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:10.260
Shigeru Satomi has gone off to America without even saying goodbye to her.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.740
And how's she taking it?

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:16.580
She took it all in without a word.

00:15:17.360 --> 00:15:20.930
The proclamation of first love... and now, it's end.

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:24.850
She really needed his support.

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:30.010
You hoped that she'd recover on this stage...

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:32.880
That's why you're forcing her to perform, isn't it?

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.600
Mizuki!

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:40.350
Whether she sinks or swims as an actress depends on you.

00:15:40.350 --> 00:15:42.760
Right now, she's walking a tightrope.

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:47.000
While she's under contract, her very soul belongs to you.

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.070
She belongs to Daito Entertainment!

00:15:50.070 --> 00:15:51.230
No.

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:53.520
To you.

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.810
What do you mean she's going on stage?

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.720
You can't be serious!

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:03.170
I can't have her showing her face again...

00:16:03.170 --> 00:16:06.530
Not now that I've finally managed to chase her away!

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.670
Opening Today! <i>The Golden Fruit</i>

00:16:10.980 --> 00:16:13.190
I guess everyone gets nervous on an opening night.

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:15.820
Not to mention that her name is on everyone's lips at the moment.

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:19.490
Go home! Leave!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:22.590
I will never abandon this orchard.

00:16:22.590 --> 00:16:26.230
Grandpa, look how many apples I picked!

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:30.180
Where's Bell?

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:32.230
She's getting ready to go to the master's house.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:35.630
Do you recognize that girl from somewhere?

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:37.970
Isn't she the girl who was in that no-show scandal?

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:42.560
Oh Grandpa, do you think the master cares about these apples?

00:16:42.560 --> 00:16:45.500
He's got his eye on a different apple; a blond one.

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:50.960
Doesn't matter what he is though, if he wants to join this family.{TC}

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.590
Marge?

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.730
I heard that she intentionally had her own mother sectioned...

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:59.190
to boost her own publicity!

00:16:59.190 --> 00:17:00.440
Mom!

00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:06.460
Mom...

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.360
Oh no, I didn't just do that...

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:11.220
Well, Marge,

00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:14.350
why don't you go and check on your sister?

00:17:14.350 --> 00:17:18.500
Send her out here, will you?

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:22.260
Maya!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:31.850
You're a good girl, Marge. Take a seat.

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:31.850
But, because of me... my mom...

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:34.710
Tell me, Marge: where's Bell?

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:39.710
She sacrificed her own mother just to be on stage!

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:41.190
Wh-What do you want... with Bell?

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:42.670
Well, actually, I...

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:44.410
I can't move.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.820
I can't put on Marge's mask!

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:54.250
I can't act... I'm too inadequate to be an actress!

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:02.440
They're saying things like that about her?

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:06.180
I keep hearing strange rumors, you know.

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:08.520
When they were shooting <i>Heavenly Light</i>,

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.840
props kept disappearing from the set, and then,

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:14.210
someone sabotaged a piece of the set so that she almost fell from a great height.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:17.930
All this was happening around Maya Kitajima?

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.470
It's all rather strange.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:24.180
Then, there's that girl who was acting as her assistant.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:27.280
Her acting's just like Maya's.

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:30.580
She had an assistant who acts just like her on stage?

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.210
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.860
Hello, Ayumi!

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:53.710
Are you here to watch your mother's shoot?

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:56.960
Yes. May I watch from the monitor room?

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.430
I don't want to get in the way.

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:00.100
Sure. No problem.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:08.220
She's good. Her acting's exactly like Maya's.

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:12.050
But there's a glaring flaw in her acting.

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.270
What?

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:17.340
This scene was ad-libbed before, due to an accident on set.

00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:18.560
Yes, that's true.

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:22.570
This girl is depicting the Satoko that Maya Kitajima created.

00:19:23.110 --> 00:19:24.650
I'm sorry to have kept you waiting.

00:19:23.730 --> 00:19:29.440
She's nothing but a fake. Her acting has no self-confidence or individuality.

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.050
Self-confidence?

00:19:31.050 --> 00:19:32.470
That's right.

00:19:32.470 --> 00:19:35.620
In that regard, Maya was perfect.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.210
Maya was able to play any role with the sort of charisma...

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.600
that really pierced people's hearts.

00:19:40.600 --> 00:19:42.520
She was born to be an actress.

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:47.910
It's a shame. If it had been Maya's Satoko...

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:51.390
the show would have been a hit.

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:55.650
We're in a pretty bad spot ourselves.

00:19:55.650 --> 00:19:57.370
You realize we could sell our story to the papers...

00:19:57.370 --> 00:20:01.810
About how we pretended to kidnap her so that Norie Otobe could steal the spotlight.

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:08.860
Then, I'll just hand you over to the police as Maya Kitajima's kidnappers.

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:12.150
Let me remind you that you have absolutely no proof that I put you up to it.

00:20:12.150 --> 00:20:15.570
You'd do well to remember that. All eyes are on you.

00:20:15.570 --> 00:20:20.140
Whatever. Here's your money; now, stay out of Tokyo for a while.

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:24.160
Well, I have to say this is a surprise.

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.050
What are you doing here?

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:29.470
I haven't been home for a while.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.010
Yes, it's been too long.

00:20:31.010 --> 00:20:33.080
I'm sorry, Father.

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:36.380
It's all right. I recognize that, beyond being my daughter,

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:37.870
you are an actress first and foremost.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:42.020
I know I've always turned down offers to be in your movies,

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:44.790
but I have a favor to ask of you today.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:46.070
What kind of favor?

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:48.060
You have always been careful not to ask for any special favors from your parents.

00:20:49.150 --> 00:20:51.370
If you help me this once,

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:54.050
I promise to appear in any role you wish!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:21:00.260
Well, this <i>is</i> a surprise. I can't imagine what you could possibly want in return.

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:03.250
You're not an understudy this time.

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:05.790
You're in the starring role!

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:07.280
I hear you.

00:21:07.280 --> 00:21:09.470
I must not fail.

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:15.020
I would now like to announce the roles for <i>Camille's Portrait</i>.

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.880
The lead of Maria Karenstein will be played by:

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:19.170
Norie Otobe.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:25.240
And the role of the vampire, Camille, goes to: Ayumi Himekawa.

00:21:29.710 --> 00:21:32.110
Ayumi Himekawa?

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:37.820
She's renowned throughout the acting world. So, why isn't she in the lead role?

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:43.340
It's nice to meet you, Norie Otobe.

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:48.470
I'm going to show you the true value of a shining jewel.

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
Chikazukitai noni toozaketeshimau

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:18.080
I want to be close to you, but you're distancing yourself.

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
Dakishimetai toki wazato hanareteshimau

00:22:18.080 --> 00:22:31.320
When I want to hold you, you deliberately run away.

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
Marude jishaku no N to N no you da ne

00:22:31.320 --> 00:22:44.070
We're like two poles on a magnet...

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Otagai amari nimo nisugita seikana?

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:55.190
Maybe we're too alike?

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
Motto motto sunao na hitomi de mitsureba

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:09.920
If you allow your eyes to see the truth,

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
Yodonderu izumi mo suki tooru hazusa

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:21.510
even quagmires will become crystal clear.

00:23:21.950 --> 00:23:26.100
Maya Kitajima is my one and only rival.

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:30.490
I'm not going to let you get away with this, you coward.

00:23:30.490 --> 00:23:32.920
I will avenge her.

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:39.010
Stand up! Rise from your sorrow and return to my level.

00:23:39.010 --> 00:23:42.620
Why are you running away? Are you really going to throw away the theater?

00:23:43.180 --> 00:23:45.710
I won't accept that!

00:23:45.710 --> 00:23:50.320
The fight for <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> hasn't been settled yet!

00:23:45.910 --> 00:23:51.580
Episode 29 - Camilla's Portrait
